NAME: Backgammon

DESCRIPTION:

Play Backgammon against the
CPU. Landscape orientation.
You are White (bottom), moving
toward point 1. The CPU is
Black (top), moving toward 24.

Controls:
- New (left of ?): opening
  roll; higher die plays
  first using those two
  numbers
- Easy / Medium (under New):
  tap to cycle difficulty
- Status is below that
  (Your Move, CPU Wins, ...)
- RstMv (bottom right, under
  status): after you play a
  checker, tap to undo this
  turn and start it over

Tap a point (or the bar) to
select, then tap a destination
or your bear-off tray. Hits
send a blot to the bar.

No doubling cube.

CPU uses expectiminimax with
a hand-crafted heuristic.
Easy is 1-ply; Medium is
2-ply over the best 1-ply
candidates. Hard is planned
for a later version.

NOTES:

This miniApp was generated
by AI.
